   "Cross-listed courses printed as separate lines in elective lists (e.g., ENVRN 7/GEOG 7, GLOBAL 3/MEDIA 3, PHILOS 51/POL SC 51) are recorded as separate entries, as printed; only the core courses printed with 'or' are recorded as alternatives.",
